<title>TURKEY: BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULT.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-MEN'S EUROLEAGUE RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a men's EuroLeague basketball championship match played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Ulkerspor (Turkey) 73 CSKA Moscow (Russia) 76 (41-42)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ulkerspor: Godfread 27, Haluk 12, Orhun 9</p>
<p>CSKA Moskow: Panov 24, Koudelin 17, Daineko 16.</p>
